"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gPTHjoGYjunbgZurPNtfupqFHU7.jpg"},{"id":3502312,"name":"Yoko Kima","role":"Student"},{"id":3502314,"name":"Asami Nagata","role":"Student"},{"id":3502315,"name":"Keiko Yoshida","role":"Student"},{"id":3502316,"name":"Yoshiko Matsumaru","role":"Student"},{"id":3502318,"name":"Yoho Naose","role":"Student"},{"id":6471386,"name":"Kaoru Kaze","role":"Student"},{"id":2323752,"name":"Maki Ikeda","role":"Yoko Tsuji"},{"id":3502319,"name":"Takashi Takayama","role":"Takehiko Nomi"},{"id":3502320,"name":"Toshihiko Takeda","role":"Yamamura"},{"id":3502321,"name":"Chihiro Shirai","role":"Young Sadako"},{"id":3502322,"name":"Mantarô Koichi","role":"President"},{"id":2285226,"name":"Shinkichi Noda","role":"Member of the Press"},{"id":3502323,"name":"Kazufumi Nakai","role":"Member of the Press"},{"id":553450,"name":"Makoto Kakeda","role":"Kanrinin"},{"id":553811,"name":"Kanehiro Ri","role":"Komiya kameraman"},{"id":20311,"name":"Yûrei Yanagi","role":"AD Okazaki","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eDwCy1W4KHXdtcjxqLMOwXbzi1U.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Ring","overview":"Reiko Asakawa è una giornalista che sta indagando sulla morte inspiegabile della propria nipote e di alcune delle sue amiche che, si dice, avessero visto il contenuto di una videocassetta esattamente una settimana prima della morte. Le ricerche la conducono in una località di vacanza dove trova la videocassetta, che contiene una serie di immagini surreali, e vedendola anch'essa diventa vittima della maledizione."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Ring","overview":"A mysterious video has been linked to a number of deaths, and when an inquisitive journalist finds the tape and views it herself, she sets in motion a chain of events that puts her own life in danger.","tagline":"One curse, one cure, one week to find it."},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"リング","overview":"某テレビ局のディレクターである浅川玲子は、都市伝説にまつわる取材の中で、見た者を1週間後に死に至らしめる「呪いのビデオ」に関わったと噂される男女が、数日前に奇怪な死を遂げた自分の姪、大石智子と同日の同時刻に死亡していることに気づく。調査を進めた玲子は、同時に死んだ智子たち4人の間には交友関係があり、彼らが1週間前に伊豆の貸し別荘「伊豆パシフィックランド」に宿泊していたこと、そしてその際に撮影されたフィルム写真上の4人の顔が不気味に歪んでいることに着目する。彼らの死の謎を突きとめようとして問題の貸し別荘を訪れた玲子は、そこで貸出されていた不審なビデオの映像を見てしまい、直後に不気味な無言電話を受け取る。これを境に、玲子自身の写真もまた死んだ4人と同様に歪んだ顔で写るようになってしまう。","tagline":"ビデオに殺されるなんて。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9sOu4fjcVSvFJbPSdMmRl5hCneO.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sGhbO6muh1Fnpa7nkxYCfvmgWCo.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"enrichment":{"status":"ready","hasMissingEpisodeMetadata":false}}
